  - id: 19
    fadeOutSeconds: 0.4
    fadeInSeconds: 0.6
    beats:
    - speaker: SPASSKY
      line: "\u2014 you were the only one who couldn't tell me where you were."
      voClip: {fileID: 0}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
    keepScreenLit: 0
  - id: 20
    fadeOutSeconds: 0.4
    fadeInSeconds: 0.6
    beats:
    - speaker: SPASSKY
      line: He locked it. You unlocked it. One of those took a decision.
      voClip: {fileID: 0}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
    keepScreenLit: 0
  - id: 21
    fadeOutSeconds: 0.4
    fadeInSeconds: 0.6
    beats:
    - speaker: SPASSKY
      line: She agreed with you. That's not the same as it being true.
      voClip: {fileID: 0}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
    keepScreenLit: 0
  - id: 22
    fadeOutSeconds: 0.4
    fadeInSeconds: 0.6
    beats:
    - speaker: SPASSKY
      line: She's the one who called us. Sit with that.
      voClip: {fileID: 0}
      holdSecondsIfNoClip: 4
      memoryFlagToSet: 
    keepScreenLit: 0
